{"id":8834718105799,"title":"Autumn Cardinals Perched Above Large Sunflowers Quilt with Cardinal Birds","handle":"autumn-cardinals-perched-above-large-sunflowers-quilt-with-cardinal-birds-9a3b408b20-9a3b408b20","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome warm holiday cheer and natural beauty into your home with this lovely quilt set from Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed design of vibrant red cardinals perched among golden sunflowers, this bedspread brings a touch of cozy autumn and winter charm to any guest room, bedroom, or seasonal display. Perfect as a thoughtful holiday gift or a rustic addition to your own bedding collection, it offers lightweight warmth that is comfortable for year-round use, camping, or lounging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by choosing your preferred size, adding optional matching pillowcases, or adding custom name text for a truly unique gift.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Feel:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, consistent warmth in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Highly functional as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or travel blanket for camping and outdoor activities.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in five convenient sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to suit any bed or space.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simple to clean and maintain; machine wash separately in cold water and air dry or tumble dry without heat to keep it fluffy and soft.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes one high-quality printed quilt with the option to add matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) to complete your bedding set.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuilt Set\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eColor\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eXmas Couple Red Bird\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAnimal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBird\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePatchwork\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSeasons\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWinter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThrow\/Twin\/Full\/Queen\/King\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCustomization\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 text input\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-26T17:08:21-05:00","created_at":"2026-07-26T15:53:08-05:00","vendor":"Jeminise","type":"Quilt","tags":["amazon-import","amazon-parent-b0djpc8jwx","Christmas Quilt","Floral Quilt","Personalized Blanket","Qu